							"description": "The response format; Accept 'json', 'soap'"
						}
					]
				},
				"description": "### POST Request to Get Courses\n\nThis endpoint allows you to retrieve a list of courses associated with a specific email address.\n\n#### Request Body\n\n- `email` (string, required): The email address for which the courses are to be retrieved.\n    \n\n#### Response\n\nThe response will contain an array of course objects with the following properties:\n\n- `id` (integer): The unique identifier of the course.\n    \n- `shortname` (string): The abbreviated name of the course.\n    \n- `fullname` (string): The full name of the course.\n    \n\nIn case of an error, the response will include the following properties:\n\n- `exception` (string): Details of any exceptions that occurred.\n    \n- `errorcode` (string): Error code, if applicable.\n    \n- `message` (string): Error message, if applicable.\n    \n- `debuginfo` (string): Additional debug information, if available."
			},
